# Testing

Use Vitest. Server API tests use Supertest against the exported `app` (do not listen on a port).
Client tests use React Testing Library. Cover auth, provider manager, chat/message CRUD, files, memory, and GPT CRUD as those phases land.
Do not hit real paid AI APIs in unit tests; inject fake adapters.
Do not assert on secrets or log output that might contain credentials.
